{"sections":[{"slug":"oLKE","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"oLKE"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">算畴左</span> Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"算畴左 Kan 扩张"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">类似于左</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Kan扩张","text":"Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张</span>"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">是函子范畴之间拉回的左伴随</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对于余完备</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/算畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">算畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的态射</span> $f\\colon \\mathcal O\\to\\mathcal P$, <span lang=\"zh\">在代数范畴之间也有拉回</span> $f^*\\colon \\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal C)\\to\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathcal O}(\\mathcal C)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的左伴随</span>\n$$\r\n    f_! \\colon \\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathcal O}(\\mathcal C)\\to\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal C),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">称为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/oLKE","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">算畴左</span> Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张</span>"}},{"Plain":" (operadic left Kan extension). <span lang=\"zh\">代数范畴之间的拉回可视为遗忘函子</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而算畴左</span> Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张给出</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">自由代数</span></strong>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">具体计算式</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $A\\in\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathcal O}(\\mathcal C)$, $P\\in\\mathcal P$,\n$$\r\n    (f_!A)(P) = \\operatorname{colim}_{\\alpha\\colon f(O)\\to P\\text{活性}} \\pi(\\alpha)_! A(O),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $O\\in\\mathcal O^\\otimes$, $\\pi\\colon \\mathcal P^\\otimes\\to\\mathsf{Fin}_*$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">分解同调</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/分解同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">分解同调</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}